msgid "功能介绍"
msgstr ""

#: flowing:5 of
msgid "Flowing 的核心立场是「框架只提供机制，不提供策略」。包结构三层："
msgstr ""

#: flowing:7 of
msgid ""
"**框架核心**：``runtime`` / ``agent`` / ``subagents`` / ``message`` / "
"``context`` / ``parsable`` / ``params`` / ``tool`` / ``model`` / "
"``hooks`` / ``lists`` / ``errors`` / ``snapshot`` / ``providers`` / "
"``persistence`` / ``parser`` / ``paths`` / ``provide`` / ``compiler`` —— "
"本模块顶层导出其中面向日常使用的符号。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing:13 of
msgid ""
"**内置扩展**：``flowing.plugins``（``skills`` / ``comm`` / ``cron`` / "
"``workflow`` / ``clipboard``）——随包发布、显式 ``runtime.install(...)`` 启用。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing:15 of
msgid "**应用层**：``flowing.composables``（``use_xxx(agent)`` 纯函数式注入）。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing:17 of
msgid ""
"运行模型锚点：消息级树（``Message.id`` + ``parent_id`` 链， ``current_head_id`` 指向消息 "
"id）；Turn 仅为逻辑执行阶段（执行期载体 :class:`flowing.agent.TurnContext`，不落盘、不进树）；能力三正交"
" （可执行对象 / LLM 可见声明 / Agent 级绑定，推广到 Tool / 子 Agent / Skill）；provide-inject"
" 沿 ``_parent_id`` 链上溯；实例级钩子系统。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing:24 of
msgid "设计动机"
msgstr ""

#: flowing:25 of
msgid ""
"顶层导出收敛到「写一个 Agent 项目一定会 import」的最小集合；其余符号 "
"（异常明细、快照视图、内部容器）经子模块显式导入，保持顶层命名空间 可读、可记忆。"
msgstr ""

