msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.cancel_background_task:8 of
msgid "同步方法：``task.cancel()`` 为协作式——执行体可在 await 点收 ``CancelledError`` 后自行决定收尾。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.cancel_all_background_tasks:1 of
msgid "取消全部在册后台任务。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.cancel_all_background_tasks:5 of
