":meth:`remove` 的 head 专用便捷包装：删除当前 head 并返回被删除 的消息 id。空树（``current_head_id"
" is None``）时返回 ``None``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.pop:18 of
msgid ""
"连续 ``pop()`` 会把 head 链从新到旧逐条删除；全部删完后 ``current_head_id is "
"None``，下一条消息成为新根。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.pop:21 of
msgid "被删除的消息 id；空树返回 ``None``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.pop:23 of
msgid ":meth:`remove`、:meth:`push`"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.push:1 of
msgid "把一条消息挂到 ``current_head_id`` 之下并落盘，head 前移。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.push:5 of
msgid ""
"回合外的消息树追加入口：``msg.parent_id = current_head_id`` → 挂入 ``_messages`` → 落盘 →"
" ``current_head_id = msg.id`` （写透 core 袋）。它也是回合内挂树的核心写路径；本方法不 dispatch "
"turn 族钩子、不写 ``turn.message_ids``——这两部分由回合内的挂树入口 在调用本方法前后补齐。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.push:14 of
msgid "``msg.id`` 已存在于 ``_messages`` 时抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.push:15 of
msgid "``current_head_id`` 为 ``None`` 时，``msg`` 成为新根 （``parent_id=None``）。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.branch:14 flowing.agent.Agent.push:18 of
msgid "``msg.id``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.push:20 of
msgid ":meth:`pop`、:meth:`branch`"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.branch:1 of
msgid "把一条消息挂到指定亲节点下（``None`` = 新根），不移动 head。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.branch:5 of
msgid ""
":meth:`MessageChain.branch` 的 Agent 层透传。调用方传入新消息 与基点；只创建节点并落盘，不改变 "
"``current_head_id``。"
msgstr ""

